    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "d6394529-e0a8-4779-92bf-179a3ad7edc4",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Twins That Tick Me Off",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121282124806",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository deb93f61-a6c2-4691-8524-1353510483c4).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47.\r\rToday&apos;s most annoying NPC contract focuses on two buddies in Sgail. They are, in my opinion, the most annoying NPCs because it&apos;s bad enough to be playing Isle of Sgail, and then you run into the two elite guards, one of which enforces EVERY guard disguise. It&apos;s annoying.\r\rBut now it&apos;s time for you to suffer through this yourself. I have found 4 other targets sprinkled around the map along their route, and then you must kill one of the twins without the other spotting you.\r\rGood luck.",
